],[39.459,39.792]]},{"key":"price#6","text":"Bars are scaled to the dearest price per gram. Photos: official, eatbetterco.com.","words":[[40.048,41.072],[41.092,41.152],[41.209,41.552],[41.605,41.712],[41.752,41.872],[41.925,42.272],[42.325,42.592],[42.652,42.832],[42.912,43.672],[43.735,44.472],[44.512,45.072],[45.132,46.672]]},{"key":"price#7","text":"Worked out from the table: 100 ÷ price per gram.","words":[[47.152,47.552],[47.592,47.712],[47.744,47.872],[47.892,47.952],[48.019,48.672],[48.752,49.312],[50.032,50.192],[50.219,50.352],[50.392,50.512],[50.592,50.992]]},{"key":"price#8","text":"Read the bars, not the box size","words":[[51.216,51.792],[51.812,51.872],[51.968,52.552],[52.602,52.752],[52.792,52.912],[52.972,53.152],[53.232,53.552]]},{"key":"price#9","text":"The namkeen combo is the cheapest per gram and the laddoo boxes are the dearest. Now look at the two laddoo boxes: is the bigger one cheaper per gram, the way you would expect?","words":[[53.852,54.512],[54.612,55.152],[55.232,55.632],[55.712,55.872],[55.912,56.032],[56.085,56.512],[56.572,56.752],[56.832,57.152],[57.252,57.552],[57.572,57.632],[57.712,58.032],[58.112,58.512],[58.572,58.752],[58.792,58.912],[58.965,59.472],[59.712,60.432],[60.464,60.592],[60.619,60.672],[60.712,60.832],[60.892,61.072],[61.112,61.392],[61.485,62.032],[62.219,62.592],[62.632,62.752],[62.786,62.992],[63.032,63.152],[63.202,63.552],[63.592,63.712],[63.792,64.232],[64.262,64.352],[64.392,64.512],[64.552,64.672],[64.685,64.752],[64.821,65.272]]},{"key":"price#10","text":"You will check this yourself on a 3D scale in the first activity.","words":[[65.552,66.272],[66.288,66.352],[66.405,66.672],[66.704,66.832],[66.876,67.232],[67.259,67.312],[67.352,67.392],[67.472,67.792],[67.859,68.192],[68.245,68.352],[68.372,68.432],[68.472,68.672],[68.734,69.233]]},{"key":"price#explain","text":"Here's the idea: To compare snack prices fairly, we look at the price for one gram. Divide the price by the grams, and you can compare a small box with a big one.","words":[[70.08,70.192],[70.212,70.272],[70.368,71.152],[71.205,71.312],[71.362,71.712],[71.765,72.032],[72.089,72.432],[72.501,73.232],[73.285,73.392],[73.424,73.552],[73.579,73.632],[73.672,73.792],[73.845,74.112],[74.152,74.272],[74.332,74.512],[74.592,74.992],[75.129,75.952],[75.992,76.112],[76.165,76.432],[76.485,76.592],[76.612,76.672],[76.765,77.472],[77.512,77.632],[77.672,77.792],[77.832,77.952],[78.002,78.352],[78.392,78.432],[78.485,78.752],[78.832,79.072],[79.104,79.232],[79.272,79.312],[79.352,79.472],[79.532,79.792]]},{"key":"drivers#0","text":"Three reasons a gram costs what it costs","words":[[80.645,80.912],[80.962,81.312],[81.352,81.392],[81.456,81.712],[81.779,82.112],[82.144,82.272],[82.299,82.352],[82.432,82.832]]},{"key":"drivers#1","text":"Raw material Bill of Materials (BOM)","words":[[83.212,83.872],[83.943,84.512],[84.672,85.312],[85.339,85.392],[85.456,86.032],[86.232,87.072]]},{"key":"drivers#2","text":"Premium ingredients like dates, almonds, cashews, quinoa, and seeds carry a substantially higher unit cost than refined flour (maida), potatoes, or palm oil used in conventional snacks.","words":[[87.702,88.192],[88.239,88.752],[88.8,88.992],[89.072,89.712],[89.772,90.432],[90.48,91.152],[91.232,91.872],[91.912,92.032],[92.125,92.592],[92.712,93.312],[93.352,93.392],[93.438,94.032],[94.089,94.432],[94.48,94.672],[94.752,95.072],[95.136,95.392],[95.452,95.872],[95.952,96.352],[96.552,97.472],[97.534,98.112],[98.219,98.432],[98.512,98.832],[98.892,99.072],[99.168,99.552],[99.579,99.632],[99.675,100.192],[100.272,100.792]]},{"key":"drivers#3","text":"Clean-label value proposition","words":[[101.032,102.352],[102.419,102.752],[102.805,103.392]]},{"key":"drivers#4","text":"A value-based pricing premium from health-conscious consumers","words":[[103.872,104.272],[104.352,105.072],[105.132,105.552],[105.612,106.032],[106.096,106.352],[106.398,107.072],[107.136,107.712]]},{"key":"drivers#5","text":"Eliminating artificial preservatives, bad fats, and refined sugars commands a value-based pricing premium from health-conscious consumers.","words":[[108.064,109.152],[109.203,109.712],[109.776,110.672],[110.752,110.992],[111.056,111.392],[111.412,111.472],[111.542,112.032],[112.089,112.432],[112.512,113.152],[113.232,113.312],[113.379,114.032],[114.092,114.512],[114.572,114.992],[115.072,115.392],[115.438,116.112],[116.176,116.792]]},{"key":"drivers#6","text":"Volume & multi-pack discounting","words":[[117.026,118.192],[118.312,118.432],[118.499,119.152],[119.205,119.792]]},{"key":"drivers#7","text":"Shipping and primary packaging overhead is shared across more units.","words":[[120.503,121.072],[121.112,121.232],[121.302,121.792],[121.84,122.272],[122.316,122.672],[122.859,123.232],[123.266,123.472],[123.518,123.792],[123.84,124.032],[124.112,124.552]]},{"key":"drivers#8","text":"Larger combo boxes (e.g., Ultimate Snack Box at ₹1.13/g) reduce shipping and primary packaging overhead per unit, allowing brands to offer lower price-per-gram rates on bundled purchases.","words":[[124.741,125.632],[125.685,125.952],[126.032,126.432],[126.552,127.312],[127.383,127.952],[128.005,128.272],[128.352,128.592],[128.645,128.752],[128.792,131.272],[131.335,131.712],[131.748,132.032],[132.092,132.272],[132.332,132.752],[132.792,133.152],[133.196,133.552],[133.612,133.792],[133.872,134.512],[134.565,134.992],[135.049,135.392],[135.445,135.552],[135.592,135.792],[135.859,136.192],[136.245,137.072],[137.125,137.392],[137.472,137.632],[137.682,138.032],[138.096,138.752]]},{"key":"drivers#explain","text":"In simple words: Three things change what a gram costs: the ingredients, a clean-label promise, and buying in bigger multi-packs.","words":[[139.579,139.632],[139.689,140.032],[140.112,140.872],[140.932,141.232],[141.289,141.632],[141.689,142.032],[142.064,142.192],[142.232,142.272],[142.336,142.592],[142.659,143.072],[143.192,143.552],[143.605,144.272],[144.472,144.672],[144.739,145.392],[145.442,146.112],[1